										<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3"></path>
										</svg>
									  </span>
									</summary>
									<div class="px-6 py-4 text-white text-base leading-relaxed">
									  Project timelines vary depending on scope and complexity. Depending on the service, a simple tattoo design typically takes 1-2 days for drawing, while more complex designs may take 3-4 days. Of course, each can be refined through revisions. Web and Brand development projects can range from 4-8 weeks for simple websites to 3-6 months for more complex applications. Livery design projects typically take 2-4 weeks, while animation projects can vary widely based on length and complexity. We'll provide a detailed timeline estimate during the initial consultation.
									</div>
								  </details>

