										</svg>
									  </span>
									</summary>
									<div class="px-6 py-4 text-white text-base leading-relaxed">
									  Depending on the kind of project, I offer various levels of post-completion support. For tattoo designs, I provide guidance on aftercare and am available for touch-ups if needed. For web and brand development projects, I offer a 30-day support period to address any issues or questions that arise after launch. I also provide ongoing maintenance and update services for an additional fee. For livery design and animation projects, I am available for revisions and updates as needed to ensure your satisfaction with the final product.
